<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center opacity-40" data-alt="A striking, high-tech abstract background image representing secure enterprise device management. It features a deep navy blue base with intricate, electric blue glowing circuit patterns, geometric network nodes, and soft, ethereal ambient light leaks. The visual style is modern, hyper-professional, and suggests absolute high-level cybersecurity and infrastructure protection, designed for a premium corporate software suite." style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBGf9czfJzgAavaN_hEIsUWRO9N7yyR9N9194XmG6Ae0Xns6h-exM04btf6rhfhiry-VXs9frW6ojJWreu4Jc4kcg3h9-Ve1rO4Vf4eY_Yg48kUhdXxNUdOm19bHLckPwQdPP_3VDCor3e_6_ohS-QVfWWe8gE36ZCD-N-ZA2ELRkdN16z4yJVCYaRaGz90MKrKvzonnUPcXvjTIEMFjt4bgvWnYRucYhslcW6yv8tyiLkIZLETbBU')"></div>
